{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/macos/Runner/Base.lproj/MainMenu.xib","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T11:12:10.832854Z","id":"2c501aefc00e3a90a12cab165d1d5f3c1ac528a4d1e8808a640c2355d9b486ee","body":{"detail":"The Edit menu holds exactly the spec's list (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-18-professional-ui-design.md §4.8: Undo, Redo, Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste and Match Style, Delete, Select All, Find › Find…). The removed items were Flutter's template defaults and worked only for a page's WKWebView (for example Check Spelling While Typing in a page's field). Find… itself reaches nothing in a Flutter view and only what WKWebView answers to performFindPanelAction: in a page.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":102},"end":{"line":164},"content_hash":"8e7912b72ac57e28b8102786d2c33bc30aad2e5b5ba3f462d42500c7ed2f2e5e"},"summary":"Edit no longer has Spelling and Grammar, Substitutions, Transformations, Speech, or Find's Find Next, Find Previous and Use Selection for Find","tags":["macos","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
